four versions published 2011-04-07, 24,389 downloads, same etymology.

Free: npm, crates.io, Homebrew formula and cask, Debian. No company,
trademark or business entity named Pidly. Of 27 GitHub repos matching the
name only pIDLy has more than one star.

Domains: pidly.com is a parked GoDaddy for-sale page, pidly.app resolves but
serves a Cloudflare 530, pidly.dev, pidly.io and pidly.sh have no DNS.

Clear for a shell tool distributed by Homebrew or git clone. PyPI and
RubyGems are permanently closed to the name, which only matters if a Python
or Ruby wrapper ever wants it.
